---
import './editorial.css';

interface Props {
  content?: {
    title?: string;
    subtitle?: string;
  };
}

const { content = {} } = Astro.props;
const title = content.title || "Menu de Rituais & Especialidades";
---

<section id="servicos" class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-[#0f0f11] text-white border-t border-white/5 relative" data-surface-rhythm="editorial-noir-rhythm" data-card-treatment="minimal-glass-stroke">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Cabeçalho Editorial com tipografia Playfair Display inspirada no savory-plate.aura.build -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4 mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-[#803050] uppercase">
        <span>Portfólio de Cuidados</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-normal text-[#fcfbfb] tracking-tight">
        {title}
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white/70 font-light leading-relaxed">
        Cada ritual é personalizado com protocolos rigorosos e produtos de marcas consagradas mundialmente, garantindo saúde capilar e acabamento impecável.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid Editorial em 4 Pilares -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Rituais Capilares Avançados -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 hover:border-[#803050]/50 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#803050] uppercase tracking-wider">Terapia & Saúde</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-white">Rituais Capilares</h3>
          <ul class="text-xs space-y-2 text-white/75 font-light">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#803050]"></span>Queratina</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#803050]"></span>Botox</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#803050]"></span>Lifting</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#803050]"></span>Peeling</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="https://wa.me/554834331789?text=Olá,%20gostaria%20de%20consultar%20tratamentos%20capilares" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center py-2 px-4 rounded-full bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-xs text-white/90 border border-white/10 transition-colors">
          <span>Consultar Ritual</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Cortes, Mechas & Styling -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 hover:border-[#803050]/50 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#803050] uppercase tracking-wider">Design & Cor</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-white">Design & Estilo</h3>
          <ul class="text-xs space-y-2 text-white/75 font-light">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#803050]"></span>Cortes</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#803050]"></span>Penteados</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#803050]"></span>Alongamento</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#803050]"></span>Pintura</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#803050]"></span>Mechas</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="https://wa.me/554834331789?text=Olá,%20gostaria%20de%20agendar%20corte%20ou%20mechas" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center py-2 px-4 rounded-full bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-xs text-white/90 border border-white/10 transition-colors">
          <span>Agendar Corte</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Estética & Pés e Mãos -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 hover:border-[#803050]/50 transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#803050] uppercase tracking-wider">Harmonia Corporal</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-white">Estética & Mãos</h3>
          <ul class="text-xs space-y-2 text-white/75 font-light">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#803050]"></span>Manicure</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#803050]"></span>Pedicure</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="https://wa.me/554834331789?text=Olá,%20gostaria%20de%20serviços%20de%20manicure%20e%20estética" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center py-2 px-4 rounded-full bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-xs text-white/90 border border-white/10 transition-colors">
          <span>Ver Cuidados</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Dia da Noiva & Exclusividade -->
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-[#803050]/20 to-white/[0.03] border border-[#803050]/40 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#803050] uppercase tracking-wider">Celebração & Luxo</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-white">Dia da Noiva</h3>
          <ul class="text-xs space-y-2 text-white/80 font-light">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white"></span>Hidromassagem</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white"></span>Penteados</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white"></span>Cortes</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <a href="https://wa.me/554834331789?text=Olá,%20gostaria%20de%20informações%20sobre%20o%20Dia%20da%20Noiva" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center py-2 px-4 rounded-full bg-[#803050] hover:bg-[#802050] text-xs font-semibold text-white transition-colors">
          <span>Pacote Noiva</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Fotografia Autêntica dos Lavatórios de Relaxamento -->
    <div class="mt-16 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-lg">
        <img src="/assets/clients/salete-cabeleireira/06-salao-de-beleza-salete-cabeleireira-3.jpg" alt="Lavatórios profissionais do Salão Salete" class="w-full h-64 object-cover object-center filter brightness-95" />
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-3">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#803050] font-semibold">Ambiente & Conforto</span>
        <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl font-normal text-white">Espaço de Rituais e Lavagem Anatômica</h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/70 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Lavatórios ergonômicos com duchas direcionáveis e cadeiras reclináveis para massagens capilares, hidratações profundas e rituais Kérastase com máximo conforto.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
